Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:07:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Production-safe quote form, LocalBusiness and breadcrumb
 data, About headline

- Hide configuration banners on the production site; when the form
  backend is not configured, show an email and WhatsApp panel instead
  of a disabled form. Preview and local builds still show the banners.
- If only attachment storage is missing, hide the upload field and ask
  visitors to email documents instead.
- Add LocalBusiness (address, opening hours, area served) alongside the
  Organization data, and BreadcrumbList data on every inner page.
- Remove the comma from the About headline so it wraps cleanly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
